I also acquire an amulet of life saving.

Down into Gehennom. Tame a purple worm
with charm monster, who becomes worm 1. Buy off Asmodeus
and kill Juiblex with Burned "E" and vorpal balde.
Charm a second worm, who eats a chameleon and polymorphs into
a leprechaun (I lose a lot of worms that way). I also buy off
Baalzebub.

Turn 68232.  Reach the orcus level.  While exploring, I encounter
a cockatrice, which I promptly shoot with arrows. It leaves a
corpse.  Seizing my chance, I grab it (with gloves) and rush
Orcus'
room. I use a wand of digging to go through the back wall,
taking him by surprise from the wrong side.  He fires his
wand at me, but bounces off my shield of reflection. It bounces
all over the place.

He's had his chance. I bonk him with the cockatrice corpse,
then very carefully put the corpse in the bag of holding.
I pick-axe
his statue and take the wand.

Continue on down, killing a nazgul (3 so far this game)
and a second titan.  I find another book of identify and
rememorize it-- that is VERY useful.  Infinite scrolls of ID,
anyone?

Enter vlads tower on turn 70032. My first worm (the one that
was nOT turned into a leprechaun) also eats a chameleon
