This takes 3000 turns.  I take a fourth worm.

On turn 75013, something kills worm3. I use a
wand of undead
turning to bring him back to life, then re-charm
him using
charm monster.  Tame worm 5 at turn 75808.  He
turns to
slime a few hundred turns later. Not quite sure
how that happened
(silly -- he must have gulped one).

Find the vibrating square on turn 79582 on level 50.
It's
been a long drive but it's all easy from here.
I head
back up to the castle to begin my final preparations.

I memorize cure sickness, magic missile,
extra healing, light, and charm monster.
I drink more
smoky potions and get a wish, which I
